          <li>Identified and fixed software bugs, ensuring optimal performance and security</li>
          
        </ul>

        <div class="tech-tags">
          <span>JavaScript</span>
          <span>React</span>
          <span>Node.js</span>
          <span>Express</span>
          <span>PostgreSQL</span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>


  </div>
